To implement your new regex (const REMARKS_REGEX = /^(?!.* {2})[a-zA-Z0-9\s/&(),.-]*$/;), we need to update the filterAndWarn function so it allows your new special characters (/, &, (), ,, ., -) and continues to automatically prevent double spaces.
