Here are the precise replacements for **JournalPosting.js** and **JournalAuthorization.js**.
### 1. Replace the Validation Logic (in BOTH Posting & Authorization files)
Find your current filterAndWarn function and replace it with this updated block. I have added your requested Regex as a comment at the top of the function for developer reference.
**Find this block:**
```javascript
const filterAndWarn = (val, type) => {
    let filtered = val;
    let hasError = false;
    let msg = "Only alphabets and digits are allowed.";
    // ...

```
**Replace it with this:**
```javascript
  // Validation Rule: No double spaces, allowed chars: alphanumeric, spaces, / & ( ) , . -
  // const REMARKS_REGEX = /^(?!.* {2})[a-zA-Z0-9\s/&(),.-]*$/;

  const filterAndWarn = (val, type) => {
    let filtered = val;
    let hasError = false;
    let msg = "Only alphanumeric and / & ( ) , . - are allowed.";

    if (type === "alphanumeric_space") {
      // 1. Strip any character that is NOT alphanumeric or in the allowed special chars list
      filtered = val.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9\s/&(),.-]/g, ""); 
      if (filtered !== val) {
        hasError = true;
      }
      
      // 2. Strip leading space and collapse double spaces (enforces the (?!.* {2}) regex rule)
      const beforeSpaceTrim = filtered;
      filtered = filtered.replace(/^\s+/, "").replace(/\s{2,}/g, " ");
      if (beforeSpaceTrim !== filtered && !hasError) {
        hasError = true;
        msg = "Remark should not start with space or contain consecutive spaces.";
      }
    }

    if (hasError) {
      showSnackBar(msg, "warning");
    }
    return filtered;
  };

```
